  "description": "Fun, fast and capable\nWhyte Secta RS builds on our award-winning hardtail heritage for the demands – and terrain – of today’s trail riders. With a fully featured frame, confidence-inspiring geometry, enabling componentry, and full weatherproofing, Whyte Secta RS delivers exceptional performance in a ‘quality for money’ package that’s as easy to ride as it is to love.\n\nHighlights\n– Fully featured 6061 T6 precision formed aluminium frame.\n– 130mm RockShox Psylo Gold RC suspension fork.\n– Capable, smooth-rolling 29er wheels + Maxxis tubeless ready tyres.\n– Shimano Deore 1x12 transmission (32T chainring x 10-51 cassette).\n– Shimano four-piston hydraulic disc brakes (180mm rotors front + rear)\n– TransX RAD full-insertion dropper post (with frame size-specific drop).",
